<hr>
<table border="0" width="100%">
<tr>
<td  bgcolor="#00FFCC"><strong>文庫運営委員会（自称）</strong>  <i>2001/04/23 06:21:33</i><br></td>
<td bgcolor="#00CCFF" width="10%" align="center" nowrap>
<a href="noteky@c_notemenu_f_11_id_987974493ehpwju_id2_987974493ehpwju_ff_on.cgi">BASE NOTE</a></td></tr>
